Vendored / adapted (see the per-function notes in puf_core.py):
  Merging/puf_utils.py   PUF_SG._batched_hellinger_distance,
                         PUF_SG._compute_likelihood_row,
                         PUF_SG._jpda_marginals_row,
                         PUF_SG.fuse (association + soft Dirichlet transfer)
  Merging/utils.py       GaussianSG.merge / _merge_gaussians (FROSS hard merge)
  Merging/spatial_prior.py SpatialPrior.compute (class prior x spatial decay x
                         existence gate); the ScanNet-specific spatial scores
                         are replaced by AG-predicate scores in prior.py.
  Scripts/dataset/compute_relation_prior.py  (P_class / P_exist estimation),
                         re-implemented over the Action Genome training
                         annotations in prior.py.

Modifications: the code was restructured into free functions and a per-video
graph class, the person is kept as a per-frame (dynamic) node, relation
evidence is kept per person->object edge with one categorical Dirichlet
(attention) and per-predicate Beta evidence (multi-label spatial /
contacting heads), and a causal per-timestamp read-out was added.  See
setup/EXT_PUF.md for the full list of deviations.
